package handler

// Business codes are not declared here. They live in the IDL repository,
// idl/errors/<domain>.thrift (`const i32 OrderNotFound = 4001` with a
// comment line, registered in lint.error_ranges), and `make gen` turns them
// into kitex_gen/errcode constants:
//
//	return nil, kerrors.NewBizStatusError(errcode.OrderNotFound, "订单不存在")
//
// This file is for names this service alone needs (none at first).
//
// 业务码不在这里声明：在 idl 仓库的 idl/errors/<领域>.thrift 里加一行 const 和一行说明，
// `make gen` 后用 errcode.<名字>。本文件留给本服务自己的常量。
